
<p>David Heaney, writing for UploadVR:</p>

<blockquote>
  <p>Meta Horizon Worlds is dropping VR support in June, meaning it
will only be available as a flatscreen experience for the web and
smartphones.</p>

<p>By March 31, Meta says the Horizon Worlds app will be delisted
from Quest’s store, and key first-party worlds such as Horizon
Central, Events Arena, Kaiju, and Bobber Bay will no longer be
accessible in VR. Then, from June 15, the Horizon Worlds app will
be removed from Quest headsets, and all worlds will no longer be
accessible in VR.</p>
